  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal singleprofile models with pca_n2000 and resnet50 achieve ~0.526 accuracy. This experiment tests multiprofile (a key design choice) with avgpool aggregation (a new component) while keeping RNA/image encoders consistent. It isolates the impact of profile setting and aggregation, which are critical factors with weak prior evidence, and balances exploration of promising multimodal directions with minimal changes to proven components."
